+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>cu</primary><seco=
ndary>use of</secondary><tertiary>quick-tour version</tertiary></indexterm>=
  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>cu</primary><secondary>omis=
sion of</secondary><tertiary>quick-tour version</tertiary></indexterm> The =
word=20
+    <valsi>cu</valsi> serves as a separator between any preceding sumti an=
d the selbri. It can often be omitted, as in the following examples.</para>
