is no easy way to point to a language; one might point to a copy of this bo=
ok, and hope the meaning gets across!)</para>
+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>ellipsis</primary=
><secondary>quick-tour version</secondary></indexterm> When there are one o=
r more occurrences of the cmavo=20
