+    </example>
+    <para>serves as a translation of either=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-xIVa"/> or=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-1Acu"/>, and of many other possible=
 English sentences as well. It is not marked for tense, and can refer to an=
