+       =20
+      </listitem>
+    </itemizedlist>
+    <para>The result of these rules is to eliminate the apostrophe altoget=
her, replacing it with comma where necessary, and otherwise with nothing. I=
n addition, names and the cmavo=20
+    <valsi>i</valsi> are capitalized, and irregular stress is marked with =
an apostrophe (now no longer used for a sound) following the stressed sylla=
ble.</para>
+   =20
+   =20
+    <para>Three points must be emphasized about this alternative orthograp=
hy:</para>
