+    <itemizedlist>
+      <listitem>
+        <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>non-standard =
orthographies</primary><secondary>caveat</secondary></indexterm> It is not =
standard, and has not been used.</para>
+      </listitem>
+      <listitem>
+        <para>It does not represent any changes to the standard Lojban pho=
nology; it is simply a representation of the same phonology using a differe=
nt written form.</para>
+      </listitem>
+      <listitem>
+        <para>It was designed to aid in a planned rapprochement between th=
e Logical Language Group and The Loglan Institute, a group headed by James =
Cooke Brown. The rapprochement never took place.</para>
+       =20
+      </listitem>
