<secondary>and non-standard Lojban orthography</secondary></indexterm>  <in=
dexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>non-standard orthographies</prim=
ary><secondary>Tengwar</secondary></indexterm> Finally, an orthography usin=
g the Tengwar of F=C3=A9anor, a fictional orthography invented by J. R. R. =
Tolkien and described in the Appendixes to=20
