+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>gismu</primary><s=
econdary>as partitioning semantic space</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm=
 type=3D"general-imported"><primary>gismu</primary><secondary>selection of<=
/secondary></indexterm> The gismu do not represent any sort of systematic p=
