+    <para>Only=20
+    <valsi>lo'irlei</valsi> requires hyphenation (to avoid confusion with =
the cmavo sequence=20
+    <jbophrase>lo'i lei</jbophrase>). All six forms are valid versions of =
the lujvo, as are the six further forms using long rafsi; however, the scor=
ing algorithm produces the following results:</para>
