 of this book and the organization for the promotion of Lojban.)</para>
+    <para>The available rafsi are=20
+    <rafsi>-loj-</rafsi> and=20
+    <rafsi>-logj-</rafsi>;=20
+    <rafsi>-ban-</rafsi>,=20
