+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>du</primary><seco=
ndary>compared with me in effect</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=
=3D"general-imported"><primary>me</primary><secondary>compared with du in e=
ffect</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primar=
y>me/du equivalence</primary></indexterm> If the sumti refers to a single o=
bject, then the effect of=20
+    <valsi>me</valsi> is much like that of=20
