ppear to belong to the sumti embedded in the=20
+    <valsi>me</valsi> expression. Here is a contrasting pair of sentences:=
</para>
+    <example xml:id=3D"example-random-id-qJyi" role=3D"interlinear-gloss-e=
xample">
