+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>sumti</primary><s=
econdary>definition</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imp=
orted"><primary>simple sumti</primary></indexterm> If you understand anythi=
ng about Lojban, you know what a sumti is by now, right? An argument, one o=
f those things that fills the places of simple Lojban sentences like:</para=
>
+    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
d-VKU6">
