ndexterm> descriptions like=20
+        <jbophrase>le zarci</jbophrase>, which usually begin with a descri=
ptor (called a=20
+        <valsi>gadri</valsi> in Lojban) such as=20
+       =20
+        <valsi>le</valsi>;</para>
+      </listitem>
