+  <section xml:id=3D"section-basic-descriptors">
+    <title>The three basic description types</title>
+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>descriptions</pri=
mary><secondary>types of</secondary></indexterm> The following cmavo are di=
scussed in this section:</para>
