ant until=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"section-names"/>.) Furthermore, the selbri is often j=
ust a single brivla. Here is an elementary example:</para>
+    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
d-rBuQ">
+      <title>
+        <anchor xml:id=3D"c6e2d1"/>
