dary>implications of</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-im=
ported"><primary>descriptions</primary><secondary>non-specific</secondary><=
/indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>non-specific des=
criptions</primary></indexterm> The second descriptor dealt with in this se=
ction is=20
