ndary>and truth of selbri</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"gener=
al-imported"><primary>lo</primary><secondary>contrasted with le in truth re=
quirement</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><pr=
