ry>compared with goi for ko'a-series assignment</secondary></indexterm>  <i=
ndexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>antecedent</primary><secondary>=
for pro-bridi</secondary></indexterm> The pro-bridi=20
+    <valsi>broda</valsi> has as its antecedent the selbri=20
