m>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>lerfu</primary><secondary=
>as assignable pro-sumti</secondary></indexterm> As is explained in=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"section-lerfu-pro-sumti"/>, the words for Lojban lett=
ers, belonging to selma'o BY and certain related selma'o, are also usable a=
s assignable pro-sumti. The main difference between letter pro-sumti and ko=
