+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>multiple relative=
 clauses</primary><secondary>attaching with zi'e</secondary></indexterm> So=
metimes it is necessary or useful to attach more than one relative clause t=
o a sumti. This is made possible in Lojban by the cmavo=20
+    <valsi>zi'e</valsi> (of selma'o ZIhE), which is used to join one or mo=
