condary>compared with English <quote>and</quote></secondary></indexterm>  <=
indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>zi'e</primary><secondary>contr=
asted with logical connectives</secondary></indexterm> The most usual trans=
lation of=20
+    <valsi>zi'e</valsi> in English is=20
+    <quote>and</quote>, but=20
