+    <para><indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>BAI modal tags</pr=
imary><secondary>rationale for</secondary></indexterm> and almost any selbr=
i which represents an action may need to specify a tool. Having to say=20
+    <jbophrase>fi'o se pilno</jbophrase> frequently would make many Lojban=
 sentences unnecessarily verbose and clunky, so an abbreviation is provided=
