+    <valsi>sepi'o</valsi>.</para>
+   =20
+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>conversion</prima=
ry><secondary>of BAI cmavo</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"gene=
ral-imported"><primary>modal tags</primary><secondary>short forms as BAI cm=
avo</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>=
fi'o constructs</primary><secondary>short forms as BAI cmavo</secondary></i=
ndexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>BAI selma'o</prima=
ry><secondary>as short forms for fi'o constructs</secondary></indexterm> He=
re=20
+    <valsi>se</valsi> is used before a cmavo, namely=20
