imary><secondary>definition</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"gen=
eral-imported"><primary>afterthought connection</primary><secondary>definit=
ion</secondary></indexterm> An afterthought connection is one that is signa=
led only by a cmavo (or a compound cmavo, in this case) between the two con=
structs being connected. Forethought connection uses a signal both before t=
he first construct and between the two: the use of=20
