 sumti</primary><secondary>avoiding</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm typ=
e=3D"general-imported"><primary>vau for shared bridi-tail sumti</primary><s=
econdary>avoiding</secondary></indexterm> Since this is a chapter on rearra=
nging sumti, it is worth pointing out that=20
