+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>operand modal con=
nection</primary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primar=
y>modal operand connection</primary></indexterm> Finally, mathematical oper=
ands can be modally connected.</para>
