</primary><secondary>fi'o prohibited in</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm=
 type=3D"general-imported"><primary>fi'o</primary><secondary>restriction on=
 use</secondary></indexterm> Note: Due to restrictions on the Lojban parsin=
