+      </interlinear-gloss>
+    </example>
+    <para>In=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-dbSy"/>, the elidable terminator=20
+    <valsi>ku</valsi> has taken the place of the sumti which would normall=
y follow=20
+    <valsi>bai</valsi>. Alternatively, we could specify the one who compel=
s but keep the language vague:</para>
