+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>modal followed by=
 selbri</primary><secondary>effect on eliding cu</secondary></indexterm> An=
 alternative to using=20
+    <valsi>ku</valsi> is to place the modal cmavo right before the selbri,=
 following the=20
+   =20
+    <valsi>cu</valsi> which often appears there. When a modal is present, =
the=20
+    <valsi>cu</valsi> is almost never necessary.</para>
