 selbri</primary><secondary>contrasted with tanru modification in grammar</=
secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>modal=
 followed by selbri</primary><secondary>compared with tanru modification in=
 meaning</secondary></indexterm> In this use, the modal is like a tanru mod=
ifier semantically, although grammatically it is quite distinct.=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-613h"/> is very similar in meaning =
to:</para>
+    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
d-pVUT">
