+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>fi'o modal follow=
ed by selbri</primary><secondary>effect on eliding fe'u</secondary></indext=
erm> If the modal preceding a selbri is constructed using=20
+    <valsi>fi'o</valsi>, then=20
+    <valsi>fe'u</valsi> is required to prevent the main selbri and the mod=
al selbri from colliding:</para>
