+    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-vCzL"/>.</para>
+    <para>Note: Either BAI modals or=20
+    <jbophrase>fi'o-</jbophrase>plus-selbri modals may correctly be used i=
n any of the constructions discussed in this section.</para>
