+    <para>Relative phrases and clauses are explained in much more detail i=
n=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"chapter-relative-clauses"/>. However, there is a cons=
truction which combines a modal with a relative phrase which is relevant to=
 this chapter. Consider the following examples of relative clauses:</para>
+    <example xml:id=3D"example-random-id-qmPP" role=3D"interlinear-gloss-e=
xample">
