+
+
+ In=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-qmPP"/>,=20
+    <jbophrase>la .apasionatas.</jbophrase> refers to a particular perform=
ance of the sonata, namely the one performed by Rubinstein. Therefore, the =
relative clause=20
