+    <valsi>poi</valsi> (of selma'o NOI) to restrict the meaning of=20
+    <jbophrase>la .apasionatas</jbophrase> to the performance in question.=
</para>
+    <para>In=20
+    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-qmPr"/>, however,=20
