ary><secondary>negation of by negating selbri</secondary></indexterm>  <ind=
exterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>negation of fi'o modals</primary>=
<secondary>by negating selbri</secondary></indexterm> Note: Modals made wit=
h=20
