+    </example>
+    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>fi'o</primary><se=
condary>proscribed for sticky modals</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm ty=
pe=3D"general-imported"><primary>sticky modals</primary><secondary>fi'o pro=
scribed from</secondary></indexterm> Note: Modals made with=20
+    <valsi>fi'o</valsi>-plus-selbri cannot be made sticky. This is an unfo=
rtunate, but unavoidable, restriction.</para>
