-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>sumti reordering<=
/primary><secondary>quick-tour version</secondary></indexterm> For one reas=
on or another you may want to change the order, placing one particular sumt=
i at the front of the bridi. The cmavo=20
-    <valsi>se</valsi>, when placed before the last word of the selbri, wil=
l switch the meanings of the first and second sumti places. So</para>
-    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
