imary></indexterm> The effect is similar to what in English is called the=
=20
-    <quote>passive voice</quote>. In Lojban, the converted selbri has a ne=
w place structure that is renumbered to reflect the place reversal, thus ha=
ving effects when such a conversion is used in combination with other const=
ructs such as=20
-   =20
-   =20
-    <jbophrase>le selbri [ku]</jbophrase> (see=20
-    <xref linkend=3D"section-description-sumti"/>).</para>
