-  <section xml:id=3D"section-basic-questions">
-    <title>Questions</title>
-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>questions</primar=
y><secondary>quick-tour version</secondary></indexterm> There are many kind=
s of questions in Lojban: full explanations appear in=20
-    <xref linkend=3D"section-questions-and-answers"/> and in various other=
 chapters throughout the book. In this chapter, we will introduce three kin=
ds: sumti questions, selbri questions, and yes/no questions.</para>
