-    <quote>What?</quote> in most cases, but also serves for=20
-    <quote>When?</quote>,=20
-    <quote>Where?</quote>, and=20
-    <quote>Why?</quote> when used in sumti places that express time, locat=
ion, or cause. For example:</para>
-    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
d-k161">
