-          <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>sumti</prim=
ary><secondary>definition</secondary><tertiary>quick-tour version</tertiary=
></indexterm> argument; words identifying something which stands in a speci=
fied relationship to something else, or which has a specified property. See=
=20
-          <xref linkend=3D"chapter-sumti"/>.</para>
-        </listitem>
-      </varlistentry>
-      <varlistentry>
