-        <listitem>
-          <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>selbri</pri=
mary><secondary>definition</secondary><tertiary>quick-tour version</tertiar=
y></indexterm> logical predicate; the core of a bridi; the word or words sp=
ecifying the relationship between the objects referred to by the sumti. See=
