-          <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>cmavo</prim=
ary><secondary>definition</secondary><tertiary>quick-tour version</tertiary=
></indexterm> one of the Lojban parts of speech; a short word; a structural=
 word; a word used for its grammatical function.</para>
-         =20
-        </listitem>
-      </varlistentry>
