=3D"general-imported"><primary>single consonants</primary><secondary>contra=
sted with doubled consonants</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"ge=
neral-imported"><primary>consonant clusters</primary><secondary>definition =
of</secondary></indexterm> Consonant sounds occur in languages as single co=
nsonants, or as doubled, or as clustered combinations. Single consonant sou=
nds are isolated by word boundaries or by intervening vowel sounds from oth=
