d"><primary>buffer vowel</primary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-=
imported"><primary>consonant clusters</primary><secondary>buffering of</sec=
ondary></indexterm> Many languages do not have consonant clusters at all, a=
nd even those languages that do have them often allow only a subset of the =
