-      </pronunciation>
-    </example>
-    <para>This convention results in a consistent rhythm to the language, =
since brivla are required to have penultimate stress; some find this esthet=
ically pleasing.</para>
-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>pause</primary><s=
econdary>requirement between stressed syllables</secondary></indexterm> If =
the final syllable of one word is stressed, and the first syllable of the n=
ext word is stressed, you must insert a pause or glottal stop between the t=
wo stressed syllables. Thus</para>
-   =20
-    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
d-uqDz">
