econdary>to lujvo</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-impor=
ted"><primary>lujvo</primary><secondary>from tanru</secondary></indexterm> =
 <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>brivla</primary><secondary>f=
rom tanru</secondary></indexterm> When a concept expressed in a tanru prove=
s useful, or is frequently expressed, it is desirable to choose one of the =
possible meanings of the tanru and assign it to a new brivla. For=20
-    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-xhQP"/>, we would probably choose=
