-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>glue in lujvo</pr=
imary><secondary>y-hyphen as</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"ge=
neral-imported"><primary>y-hyphen</primary><secondary>and stress determinat=
ion</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>=
y-hyphen</primary><secondary>use of</secondary></indexterm> A=20
-    <letteral>y</letteral> (which is ignored in determining stress or cons=
