gismu</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primar=
y>rafsi</primary><secondary>uniqueness in gismu referent of</secondary></in=
dexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>rafsi</primary><sec=
ondary>use of</secondary></indexterm> Every gismu has from two to five rafs=
