 It is valid to use any of the rafsi forms in building lujvo &ndash; whiche=
ver the reader or listener will most easily understand, or whichever is mos=
t pleasing &ndash; subject to the rules of lujvo making. There is a scoring=
 algorithm which is intended to determine which of the possible and legal l=
ujvo forms will be the standard dictionary form (see=20
-    <xref linkend=3D"section-lujvo-scoring"/>).</para>
-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>unreduced lujvo</=
primary><secondary>definition</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"g=
eneral-imported"><primary>long rafsi</primary><secondary>definition</second=
ary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>4-letter ra=
