ondary>use of zmadu in forming</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"=
general-imported"><primary>comparatives</primary><secondary>use of zmadu in=
 forming</secondary></indexterm> For example,=20
-    <valsi>zmadu</valsi> (=20
