m>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>lujvo form</primary><seco=
ndary>final letter of</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-i=
mported"><primary>lujvo</primary><secondary>summary of form characteristics=
</secondary></indexterm> As noted above, CVC-form rafsi cannot appear as th=
