nfused with gismu.</para>
-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>lujvo form</prima=
ry><secondary>requirements for hyphen insertion in</secondary></indexterm> =
 <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>hyphen letter</primary><seco=
ndary>definition</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-import=
ed"><primary>hyphens</primary><secondary>use of</secondary></indexterm> Whe=
n attaching two rafsi together, it may be necessary to insert a hyphen lett=
er. In Lojban, the term=20
