th zei</secondary></indexterm>=20
-There is also a different way of building lujvo, or rather phrases which a=
re grammatically and semantically equivalent to lujvo. You can make a phras=
e containing any desired words, joining each pair of them with the special =
cmavo=20
-    <valsi>zei</valsi>. Thus,</para>
