-    </example>
-    <para>because the whole bridi of=20
-    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-2UvG"/> has been packaged up into t=
he single word=20
-    <valsi>go'i</valsi> and inserted into=20
-    <xref linkend=3D"example-random-id-EvoD"/>.</para>
-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>du</primary><seco=
ndary>as an exception within GOhA selma'o</secondary></indexterm> The excep=
tional member of GOhA is=20
-    <valsi>du</valsi>, which represents the relation of identity. Its plac=
e structure is:</para>
