ition>
-    <para>for as many places as are given. More information on selma'o GOh=
A is available in=20
-    <xref linkend=3D"chapter-anaphoric-cmavo"/>.</para>
-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>tanru</primary><s=
econdary>containing mathematical expressions</secondary></indexterm>  <inde=
xterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>mathematical expressions in tanru<=
/primary></indexterm> Lojban mathematical expressions (mekso) can be incorp=
orated into selbri in two different ways. Mathematical operators such as=20
-   =20
-    <valsi>su'i</valsi>, meaning=20
-    <quote>plus</quote>, can be transformed into selbri by prefixing them =
with=20
