-        <natlang>I didn't go to the market.</natlang>
-      </interlinear-gloss>
-    </example>
-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>bridi negation</p=
rimary><secondary>multiple</secondary></indexterm> It is also possible to h=
ave more than one=20
-    <valsi>na</valsi>, in which case pairs of=20
-    <valsi>na</valsi> cmavo cancel out:</para>
-    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
d-TuP7">
