-    <valsi>le</valsi>,=20
-    <valsi>lo</valsi>,=20
-    <valsi>la</valsi>, and the typical descriptors=20
-    <valsi>le'e</valsi> and=20
-    <valsi>lo'e</valsi>) is special. When we refer to specific individuals=
