bridi</primary><secondary>with no assignment</secondary></indexterm>  <inde=
xterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>broda-series pro-bridi</primary><s=
econdary>use as abstract pattern</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=
=3D"general-imported"><primary>broda-series pro-bridi</primary><secondary>u=
se as sample gismu</secondary></indexterm> Another use of=20
-    <valsi>broda</valsi> and its relatives, without assignment, is as=20
