-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>pro-bridi assignm=
ent</primary><secondary>stability of</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm ty=
pe=3D"general-imported"><primary>pro-sumti assignment</primary><secondary>s=
tability of</secondary></indexterm> How long does a pro-sumti or pro-bridi =
