-      </interlinear-gloss>
-    </example>
-    <para>In this example,=20
-    <valsi>mi</valsi> is already sufficiently restricted, and the addition=
al information that I am a judge is being provided solely for the listener'=
s edification.</para>
-    <example role=3D"interlinear-gloss-example" xml:id=3D"example-random-i=
d-pR53">
-      <title>
-        <anchor xml:id=3D"c8e2d4"/>
-      </title>
