econdary>selbri-first as exceptional</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm ty=
pe=3D"general-imported"><primary>selbri-first bridi</primary><secondary>eff=
ect on sumti places</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imp=
orted"><primary>sumti</primary><secondary>omitted first place in selbri-fir=
st bridi</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><pri=
mary>sumti</primary><secondary>order in selbri-first bridi</secondary></ind=
exterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>sumti</primary><seco=
ndary>order in selbri</secondary></indexterm> The general rule, then, is th=
