-    <para> <indexterm type=3D"lojban-word-imported"><primary>LE selma'o</p=
rimary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"lojban-word-imported"><primary>LA s=
elma'o</primary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary=
>converted selbri</primary><secondary>in descriptions</secondary></indexter=
m> The most important use of conversion is in the construction of descripti=
