<secondary>to access non-first place in description</secondary></indexterm>=
  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>descriptions</primary><seco=
ndary>use of SE in</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-impo=
rted"><primary>descriptions</primary><secondary>as based on first place of =
following selbri</secondary></indexterm> In every case, the description is =
about something which fits into the x1 place of the selbri. In order to get=
