ondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>SE selma=
'o</primary><secondary>extending scope of</secondary></indexterm>  <indexte=
rm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>SE selma'o</primary><secondary>scope =
of</secondary></indexterm> When converting selbri that are more complex tha=
n a single brivla, it is important to realize that the scope of a SE cmavo =
is only the following brivla (or equivalent unit). In order to convert an e=
ntire tanru, it is necessary to enclose the tanru in=20
