-        <gloss>I grasp the-mass-of water with-physical-cause I grasp the c=
up.</gloss>
-        <gloss>Causing the mass of water to be grasped by me, I grasped th=
e cup.</gloss>
-        <natlang>I grasp the water because I grasp the cup.</natlang>
-      </interlinear-gloss>
