 sentence connection</primary><secondary>relation to modal of second bridi =
in</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>f=
orethought modal sentence connection</primary><secondary>relation to modal =
of first bridi in</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"general-impor=
ted"><primary>forethought modal sentence connection for causals</primary><s=
econdary>order of cause and effect</secondary></indexterm> Note that the ca=
